  {
   "k": "a6l2o5",
   "en": "⟦0⟧ The United Kingdom maintains close ties with the Commonwealth countries of ⟦1⟧, ⟦2⟧, ⟦3⟧ and ⟦4⟧. These ⟦5⟧ were formerly part of the British Empire, but are now independent Dominions under the British Crown. They have their own governments, economies and armed forces. Certain UK focus choices affect them (e.g., construction of factories).",
