  {
   "k": "6my21v",
   "en": "⟦0⟧ Their colony of India has some local autonomy. It is represented in the game as a ⟦1⟧ called ⟦2⟧. It is possible for the UK to release British Raj as an independent country. The colony of ⟦3⟧ is also represented as a puppet under Britain. India is represented as a Colony, more autonomous than a puppet, while Malaya is represented as an Integrated Puppet, which is less autonomous than a puppet. The same fate is shared with ⟦4⟧ and ⟦5⟧. Whereas the colonies of ⟦6⟧ and the ⟦7⟧ are represented as a colony. Last but not least, the ⟦8⟧ is in the same dominion level as the Commonwealth countries.",
